script = ExtResource("1_1njg1")
grid = NodePath("Grid")
explanation = "Spawn one frog from the upper left pipe, then turn the pipe off for three turns. Activate after.

Bounce frog one off the wall. Use the bottom right pipe to trap frog one in (flipping back and forth) while the frogs spawned after the 3 block gap get sent up.

No frog limit."
